      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5de9405aea7cc52772fcc359|full_name}: Weird, I'm having no issues pressing the logout or quit buttons. I have some UiMenu layer panels in the world that can block the laser pointer, but as long as you move out of the way of those it shouldn't be an issue.\nThere isn't really anything too weird going on with layers or colliders in my world; I'm just doing an overlapsphere check on the UiMenu layer and checking for nulls to determine if the player has their menu open in order to show/hide my world options.",
      "viewerReactions": null
